# xevents CODEOWNERS
#
# Solo-operator project. This file exists as evidence, not policy —
# `xevents` is a public repository on a personal Free account, and
# GitHub does not support `Require review from Code Owners` as a
# mechanically enforced rule on personal-account repos. The
# mechanical M1 merge gate on `main` is required status checks
# (`boundary-write-set-in-diff`, `g5-report-present-and-valid`, and
# the cross-cutting invariants), configured under the branch
# protection ruleset per ADR 0014 §Identity and audit.
#
# All paths are owned by @neilweitzel. When a future org-migration
# or additional-operator scenario arises, this file becomes the
# authoritative ownership declaration.

